#
# Worked example: causal event mereology and the action/event boundary.
# Two orthogonal facets of an occurrence:
#   1. CAUSAL PART-OF — gmeow:causalPartOf relates a sub-event that genuinely
#      CAUSALLY contributes to a larger whole (the ignition is a causal part of
#      the launch). It is a specialization of the temporal gmeow:subEventOf
#      (causal ⊆ temporal) and grounds in logic:causalPartOf. The whole-rooted
#      inverse gmeow:hasCausalPart follows automatically.
#   2. THE ACTION→EVENT BOUNDARY — logic:occurrentBoundary carries whether an
#      occurrence is OPEN (on-going, an in-progress action/gmeow:Activity) or
#      CLOSED (a completed unitary whole). We reuse the logic property directly;
#      no parallel gmeow boundary property is minted.
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ex:    <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/events/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

# --- Causal mereology: the ignition causally contributes to the launch.
#     Asserted part→whole; the gmeow:subEventOf closure and the
#     logic:causalPartOf grounding both follow by inheritance, and the
#     whole-rooted gmeow:hasCausalPart inverse is derived.
ex:launch a gmeow:Event ;
    rdfs:label "the rocket launch"@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeCreation ;
    gmeow:eventTemporalFrame gmeow:temporalFrameUTCGregorian .

ex:ignition a gmeow:Event ;
    rdfs:label "first-stage ignition"@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeCreation ;
    gmeow:eventTemporalFrame gmeow:temporalFrameUTCGregorian ;
    gmeow:causalPartOf ex:launch .

# --- The action→event seam carried with logic:occurrentBoundary.
#     While the liftoff is on-going it is an OPEN action (a gmeow:Activity);
#     once complete it is a CLOSED unitary event.
ex:liftoffActivity a gmeow:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "the liftoff, in progress"@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:eventTemporalFrame gmeow:temporalFrameUTCGregorian ;
    logic:occurrentBoundary logic:Open .

ex:liftoffRecord a gmeow:Event ;
    rdfs:label "the completed liftoff"@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeCreation ;
    gmeow:eventTemporalFrame gmeow:temporalFrameUTCGregorian ;
    logic:occurrentBoundary logic:Closed .
